msgstr "调用 CMake 生成构建系统"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_flow.md:274
msgid "Compiles source code using the selected toolchain"
msgstr "使用选定的工具链编译源代码"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_flow.md:275
