msgstr "在 `build/` 目录中生成固件二进制文件"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_flow.md:277
msgid "Common Build Command Examples"
msgstr "常见构建命令示例"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_flow.md:296
msgid "Configuration File Generation Logic"
msgstr "配置文件生成逻辑"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_flow.md:298
msgid "File Hierarchy"
msgstr "文件层次结构"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_flow.md:300
msgid "Configuration files are loaded in order of increasing priority:"
msgstr "配置文件按优先级递增的顺序加载："

#: ../../source/build_config/build_flow.md:302
msgid "**chip.config** -- Chip default configuration (lowest priority)"
msgstr "**chip.config** -- 芯片默认配置（最低优先级）"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_flow.md:303
msgid "**build.config** -- User-defined build options"
msgstr "**build.config** -- 用户定义的构建选项"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_flow.md:304
msgid "**.config** -- Final merged configuration (highest priority)"
msgstr "**.config** -- 最终合并配置（最高优先级）"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_flow.md:306
msgid "Configuration Generation Flow"
msgstr "配置生成流程"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_flow.md:308
msgid "When executing `west tl-config`, the flow is:"
msgstr "执行 `west tl-config` 时，流程如下："

#: ../../source/build_config/build_flow.md:310
msgid ""
"**Parameter Processing Phase**: Parses source directory and build "
"directory options"
msgstr "**参数处理阶段**：解析源目录和构建目录选项"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_flow.md:311
msgid ""
"**CMake Configuration Phase**: Checks for existing `CMakeCache.txt`, runs"
" CMake configuration with Ninja generator"
msgstr "**CMake 配置阶段**：检查现有的 `CMakeCache.txt`，使用 Ninja 生成器运行 CMake 配置"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_flow.md:312
msgid ""
"**Configuration Target Execution**: Executes `cmake --build <build_dir> "
"--target config`"
msgstr "**配置目标执行**：执行 `cmake --build <build_dir> --target config`"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_flow.md:314
msgid "When executing `west tl-build` (with `-k/--kconfig`), the flow is:"
msgstr "执行 `west tl-build`（带 `-k/--kconfig`）时，流程如下："

#: ../../source/build_config/build_flow.md:316
msgid "**Parameter Processing**: Checks for `--board` or `--soc` parameters"
msgstr "**参数处理**：检查 `--board` 或 `--soc` 参数"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_flow.md:317
msgid ""
"**Default Configuration Generation**: Runs `scripts/kconfig.py` to "
"generate `chip.config` and `build.config`, merges into `.config`"
msgstr "**默认配置生成**：运行 `scripts/kconfig.py` 生成 `chip.config` 和 `build.config`，合并为 `.config`"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_flow.md:318
msgid "**CMake Configuration**: Passes `BOARD` and `SOC` parameters to CMake"
msgstr "**CMake 配置**：将 `BOARD` 和 `SOC` 参数传递给 CMake"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_flow.md:320
msgid "Dependencies"
msgstr "依赖关系"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_flow.md:322
msgid ""
"`.config` depends on `chip.config` and `build.config` (when automatically"
